// Workspace tying the demokit module together with the standalone
// notebook module (and, later, notebook/examples/* demos). Local
// dev resolves cross-module imports to the in-repo copies without
// replace directives. The notebook module is independently
// buildable and testable — see the Makefile's testall target.
go 1.26.2

use (
	.
	./notebook
	./notebook/examples/mathrepl
)
